{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/8/bb837feb9809e32a87836f6c1e5aedeb978a51f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC, AB = 8, BC = 7, CA = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"266\" height=\"17\" /> and side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is extended, as shown in the figure, to a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/3/1636251674ae38bb58e9b70b6d64717afdcf942a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PAB$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />\nis similar to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069e62535cc981477bdbcd1cab08908867c8dae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PCA$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e049532148caaf1c48e37658b548a6255c8d59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/613a6e628f3f9a1136da0c89d1d1c6c7d50a09db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair A=origin, P=(1.5,5), B=(8,0), C=P+2.5*dir(P--B); draw(A--P--C--A--B--C); label(&quot;A&quot;, A, W); label(&quot;B&quot;, B, E); label(&quot;C&quot;, C, NE); label(&quot;P&quot;, P, NW); label(&quot;6&quot;, 3*dir(A--C), SE); label(&quot;7&quot;, B+3*dir(B--C), NE); label(&quot;8&quot;, (4,0), S); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"428\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/51759c5d163f15c81016db64d956313190af02c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e172fde7882efbef8668bc12d1d00a4b8e924ee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{PAB}\\sim\\triangle{PCA}$\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84b52ec9725b094cc18669b5d39f8851f4425d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PC}{PA}=\\frac{6}{8}=\\frac{PA}{PC+7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"156\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377291318df52e4f013ab2bf28ee82454a9e57da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b4a6f7097a6d248118c3a9e6f195792d2025c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PC}{PA}=\\frac{6}{8}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/8/af8daee17bcf2642febf7887354b6dc9c318bfb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA=\\frac{4PC}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3aedd75941eed9e37c059575481537814fdfef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PA}{PC+7}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"99\" height=\"39\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377291318df52e4f013ab2bf28ee82454a9e57da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> in for our expression yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/0284e32a3e939c588e6999fe79b4be023267b931.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{4PC}{3}}{PC+7}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"99\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><br />\nWhich we can further simplify to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1f3c7c51f53aad2bc0ed8092452051434cc5ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16PC}{3}=3PC+21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"151\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b2f5180468e13e54c72a7362cfcfdc26e914764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7PC}{3}=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"83\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/277933c55071dfd2c40bd5d9fdbc6f0fe388f53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC=9\\implies\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"151\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w